{"@context":{"lean":"lean:","block":"block:","imports":{"@type":"@id"}},"@graph":[{"@id":"lean:module:QOU.Mathlib.SchenstedRSKSurjective","@type":"LeanModule","name":"QOU.Mathlib.SchenstedRSKSurjective","imports":["lean:module:Init","lean:module:QOU.Mathlib.SchenstedReinsertRow","lean:module:QOU.Mathlib.SchenstedRecordingTrunc"],"declarations":3,"chunks":1},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Mathlib.Schensted.insertWordRec_uninsertSteps_of_standard","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Mathlib.Schensted.insertWordRec_uninsertSteps_of_standard","kind":"theorem","line":73,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/Mathlib/SchenstedRSKSurjective.lean#L73-L96","doc":"**Every standard pair of a common shape is an insertion pair.**\n\nThe word is the one the reverse cascade recovers from `P` at the positions `Q` records. Its\ninsertion tableau is `P` by brick 27; its recording tableau is `Q` because its row-index record is\n`Q`'s position list (brick 29) and replaying that list rebuilds `Q` (brick 31). ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Mathlib.Schensted.rowIndices_uninsertSteps_of_shape","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Mathlib.Schensted.rowIndices_uninsertSteps_of_shape","kind":"theorem","line":64,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/Mathlib/SchenstedRSKSurjective.lean#L64-L71","doc":"**The recovered word's record, read from the empty tableau** — the form brick 4 consumes. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Mathlib.Schensted.uninsertSteps_fst_eq_nil","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Mathlib.Schensted.uninsertSteps_fst_eq_nil","kind":"theorem","line":50,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/Mathlib/SchenstedRSKSurjective.lean#L50-L62","doc":"**A run that empties the shape empties the tableau.** `tableauShape` is a `map`, so it preserves\nlength, and a tableau of empty shape is empty. ","signatureChunk":0}]}